# sqlplus (OCI thick, Instant Client) calling a procedure with an OUT parameter
# through dbbat against Oracle 23ai Free. One line per server response that
# opens with the IO vector (TTC message 0x0b): the TNS Data payload, two
# data-flag bytes first, exactly as extractTTCPayload receives it.
#
# These carry the same field list the thin recordings do, marshaled in the
# wide/fixed-width OCI encoding — little-endian integers of a per-call-site
# width where a thin client sends compressed ones.
#
# Regenerate with:
#   go test -tags capture -run TestCapture_SQLPlus ./internal/proxy/oracle/


